  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-27T22:54:59.622Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It was stated a long time ago it would be brought back, but it hasn't. Recently 8k pictures were made possible with minimum lag and still no panorama pictures. \nCan we have this back now?\nPanorama pictures were very effective way of capturing not a small scene of a world. Rather nearly the entire moment. This could make for some beautiful moments on club worlds with everyone surrounding the camera.",
